# name:dir:script[:needs]       dir is relative to the prepared tree (mksp.py), script runs there; a suite is green when it exits 0.
# needs = fixtures: the private image fixtures (suites/private/fixtures, never in git); skipped (exit 77) when they are missing.
# New suites of the v3 work (suites/README.md, section "Adding a suite") are appended at the end, with the same format:
#   v3reg:scripts/styles_tests:test_registry.py          (a suite in the repository itself, copied from REPO_DIRS by mksp.py)
# The lines at the end are those suites: v3wp0 (the probe, the pins, this folder, the bundle report), v3reg (WP1: the style registry, the
# catalogue, the price class, the build check), v3gate (WP3: the eye profile, the restoration gate, eye_id and seal v2; set
# SNAPEYES_CALIB and SNAPEYES_GATE_TABLE to also replay the calibration set, reported as LOCAL lines), v3single (WP5A: the singles family
# replayed against the scratch prototype's own pictures; set SNAPEYES_SCRATCH_Y3 (the wave-y3 folder) for the 4096 px pictures of the plate styles and the
# check of the port's edits, SNAPEYES_CALIB for the real calibration eyes: LOCAL lines, not counted).
r2:wave-r-back/pb/r2:test_round2.py
r3:wave-r-back/pb/r3:test_round3.py
r4:wave-r-back/pb/r4:test_round4.py
r5:wave-r-back/pb/r5:test_round5.py
fix:wave-r-back/pb/fix:test_fixes.py
admin:wave-pv/tests/admin:test_admin.py:fixtures
pay:wave-pv/tests:test_pay.py
advance:wave-pv/tests:test_advance.py
refund:wave-pv/tests:test_refund_stop.py
preview:wave-pv/tests:test_preview.py
review:wave-s/review:test_review.py
fixmk:wave-s/fixmk:test_fixmk.py
markets:wave-z/markets:test_markets.py
au:wave-z/au:test_au.py
payrev:wave-z/payrev/adv:test_payrev.py
fixer:wave-z/fixer:test_fixer.py
oldpay:wave-r-back/pb:test_pay.py
oldadv:wave-s/advance:test_advance.py
oldadmin:wave-q/admin:test_admin.py:fixtures
exp:wave-exp/suite:test_experiments.py
v3wp0:scripts/styles_tests:test_wp0.py
v3reg:scripts/styles_tests:test_registry.py
v3gate:scripts/styles_tests:test_gate_seal.py
